# Insurance Data Analysis Dashboard | Power BI

## Project Overview
Developed an interactive Insurance Data Analysis Dashboard using Microsoft Power BI to analyze insurance policies, premiums, coverage amounts, and claims.

## Key Features
- Active and Inactive Policy Analysis
- Total Premium Amount Analysis
- Claim Amount Analysis
- Claims by Claim Status
- Claim Amount by Age Group
- Policy Type Analysis
- Coverage Amount Analysis

## Tools & Technologies
- Microsoft Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX
- Data Visualization

## Dashboard Components
- KPI Cards
- Donut Chart
- Bar Chart
- Line Chart
- Ribbon Chart
- Interactive Slicers
- Detailed Insurance Data Table

## Business Objectives
- Monitor insurance policy performance.
- Analyze claim distribution and status.
- Understand premium and coverage trends.
- Explore customer and policy information.

